OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1785916143
OL,3,CFour police officers being
OL,4,Cinvestigated by watchdog after man
OL,5,Cdies in custody
OL,7,FThe police watchdog has launched an
OL,8,Finvestigation into the actions of four
OL,9,FHampshire police officers after a man
OL,10,Fdied in custody following his arrest
OL,11,Fin Portsmouth.
OL,13,FNigel Lawrence, 23, from Portsmouth,
OL,14,Fwas walking along Fratton Road among
OL,15,Fbusy traffic on 22 June when he
OL,16,Fapproached a police car.
OL,18,FInside the car were two police
OL,19,Fofficers who were taking a suspect to
OL,20,Fcustody.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
