OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1785916143
OL,3,CFour police officers being
OL,4,Cinvestigated by watchdog after man
OL,5,Cdies in custody
OL,7,FAs Mr Lawrence opened the car door,
OL,8,Fbody-worn video revealed he had what
OL,9,Fappeared to be white foam around his
OL,10,Fmouth, and appeared to be distressed.
OL,12,FThe Independent Office for Police
OL,13,FConduct (IOPC) say the officers
OL,14,Fhandcuffed him, carried out a search,
OL,15,Fand found he was in possession of
OL,16,Funlawfully controlled drugs.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1785916143
OL,3,CFour police officers being
OL,4,Cinvestigated by watchdog after man
OL,5,Cdies in custody
OL,7,FMr Lawrence was arrested and put in a
OL,8,Fpolice van, but as officers were
OL,9,Ftaking him to hospital, they pulled
OL,10,Fover to give emergency first aid
OL,11,Falongside paramedics.
OL,13,FHe died in hospital the following
OL,14,Fevening. A post-mortem examination was
OL,15,Fcarried out, and further tests are
OL,16,Fbeing carried out.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1785916143
OL,3,CFour police officers being
OL,4,Cinvestigated by watchdog after man
OL,5,Cdies in custody
OL,7,FThe IOPC is investigating the decision-
OL,8,Fmaking and actions of the four
OL,9,Fofficers who interacted with Mr
OL,10,FLawrence during this incident; the
OL,11,Fdecision to search, arrest, handcuff
OL,12,Fand detain him; and the care provided
OL,13,Fto him.
OL,15,FThe officers ` all police constables `
OL,16,Fare being investigated for gross
OL,17,Fmisconduct, relating to potential
OL,18,Fbreaches of a number of police
OL,19,Fstandards of professional behaviour.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
