OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1785916143
OL,3,CFour police officers being
OL,4,Cinvestigated by watchdog after man
OL,5,Cdies in custody
OL,7,FIOPC Director of Engagement, Derrick
OL,8,FCampbell, said: "Our thoughts and
OL,9,Fcondolences go to Mr Lawrence's family
OL,10,Fand friends, and everyone affected by
OL,11,Fhis death.
OL,13,F"As he was in the custody of police at
OL,14,Fthe time he became unwell and later
OL,15,Fdied, it is important that there is a
OL,16,Fthorough and independent investigation
OL,17,Fto establish the full circumstances
OL,18,Fsurrounding this incident."
OL,20,FAn inquest hasn't yet been opened.
